# Security Services Agreement

This Agreement is made between Wardlaw Guarding Ltd (the "Contractor") and Inchmore Retail Park Ltd (the "Client").

## 2. Patrols
2.1 The Contractor shall patrol the site every two hours overnight.
2.2 The Contractor shall record each patrol in the site log.
=== amendment ===
# Amendment No. 1

This Amendment is made on 1 November 2027 between Wardlaw Guarding Ltd (the "Contractor") and Inchmore Retail Park Ltd (the "Client").

1. Clause 14.2 is deleted and replaced with the following: "The Contractor shall carry public liability insurance of £10,000,000."
2. Clause 2.1 is amended to read: "The Contractor shall patrol the site every hour overnight."
